# sha256 of the official caddy_<version>_linux_amd64.tar.gz.
# install_caddy verifies that archive, then builds the same release with
# xcaddy and github.com/caddy-dns/cloudflare. The image installs the build,
# which is what public certificates need. The stock binary has no DNS module.
# fields: sha256 version xcaddy cloudflare-module
